        "@value": "Baby Moccasin Workshop | with Colleen Nolan |  Wed, Jan 14, 2026, 5:30 pm | Atelier Shenkman Smith"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://naccnaca-eventimages.s3.amazonaws.com/40131/baby_mocs_-_event_image__large.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Join us for the hands-on, creative experience -  Baby Moccasin Making Workshop where participants will learn how to make their own leather baby moccasins. In this fun and interactive session, we provide all the materials and tools needed to make a unique pair of soft, comfortable moccasins for a baby/toddler, whether for your own child or as a thoughtful gift.\n\nSizes range from newborn to age 4 (size 10). \n\nThis workshop is ideal for anyone interested in learning about moccasin making, making..."
      }
    ],
